WEBVTT

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:42.950
The light wave from the Bey
of the mysterious boy who beat Takao

00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:46.910
was, to my surprise,
an invisible Sacred Beast.

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:53.420
At the same time,

00:01:53.420 --> 00:01:55.260
Max in America,

00:01:55.260 --> 00:01:56.720
and Rei in China,

00:01:56.720 --> 00:02:00.600
were also defeated by
this mysterious light wave.

00:02:01.680 --> 00:02:05.600
The former BBA team who
once stood above all Bladers

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:09.440
are now being approached
by mysterious opponents.

00:02:09.770 --> 00:02:12.610
Just what kind of
motive do they have?

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:17.900
And now, the mysterious boy has
once again appeared before Takao.

00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:31.080
We meet again, mystery boy.

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:33.590
It's Ozma.

00:02:38.260 --> 00:02:40.470
What? Who is this guy?

00:02:40.470 --> 00:02:43.010
It's getting so tense...

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:46.350
I can't say I'm not a fan, though.

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:52.980
Ozma... Ozma... Ozma... Ozma...

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:57.820
You're the first one to beat the world champion.

00:02:57.820 --> 00:03:00.450
Now I can remember your name!

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:02.570
What an honor.

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:07.200
Hey, look!

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:08.870
It's Takao Kinomiya!

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:11.460
He's fighting the champion
from the other day!

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:19.880
--See you later!
--Y-yeah...

00:03:24.050 --> 00:03:26.010
Please watch out, mother!

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:28.350
Maybe you<b> should watch out!</b>

00:03:30.890 --> 00:03:34.270
Takao, that wave from that Bey

00:03:34.270 --> 00:03:36.860
has an unbelievable secret!

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:43.660
Takao!

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:46.620
This isn't the time to
be doing chores!

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:49.120
Kyoujyu!

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:51.580
Ladies!

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:53.920
Where's Takao?

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:56.340
You see, he escaped again...

00:03:56.340 --> 00:03:58.170
Escaped to where?

00:03:58.170 --> 00:03:59.880
That's what we want to know!

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:03.430
Oh, good timing, Kyoujyu.

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:05.760
You can take Kinomiya's place.

00:04:06.510 --> 00:04:08.310
That's not what I...

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:10.770
Hiromi caught up to him!

00:04:10.890 --> 00:04:11.680
Where?

00:04:11.850 --> 00:04:13.020
At the park!

00:04:13.270 --> 00:04:18.150
Takao's facing off against
some guy in a weird cape!

00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:21.070
He doesn't look like
someone from around here.

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:22.200
Well then...

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:28.200
Takao's fighting outside!

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:36.580
We've got ourselves an audience,

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:38.380
so why don't we get started?

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:40.800
You're going to do
it this time right?

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:42.260
Get serious!

00:04:42.260 --> 00:04:43.380
What?!

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:46.720
You don't have to tell me,
'cause I'm always serious!

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:48.140
Go, Takao!

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:50.810
Beat that weirdo in one blow!

00:04:50.810 --> 00:04:52.140
Yeah!

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:54.600
You can count on me!

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:56.150
Here we go!

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:57.440
Go...

00:04:57.440 --> 00:04:58.980
Time out!

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:01.480
Kyoujyu?

00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:04.700
Takao, we need to talk.

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:06.740
Don't ruin the mood!

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:08.410
Just listen to me...

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:11.740
Running away?

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:12.950
What'd you say?!

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:14.080
Just listen to me!

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:16.000
Listen to what?

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:18.330
We were just getting
to the good part!

00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:20.630
I came to tell you
something important.

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:23.710
Can't you tell me
after I beat him?

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:27.260
If I don't tell you then
you're going to lose!

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:29.140
Is that what you want?

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:32.930
It's going to be a losing
streak. A losing streak!

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:34.930
The world champion
is on a losing streak!

00:05:36.230 --> 00:05:38.230
Now that's a laugh...

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:42.110
Kyoujyu, my friend, that's a nice
necktie you've got there...

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:45.990
I wonder what could be so important...

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:47.660
Hey!

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:49.570
Wait right there! Don't move!

00:05:50.490 --> 00:05:52.080
What the heck...?

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:53.950
Watch this.

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:56.250
This is the result of
my image analysis.

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:58.830
There's a Sacred Beast
coming from Ozma's Bey.

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:00.840
This is a Sacred Beast?

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:03.460
It's corrupted with noise
so I can't say for sure,

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:04.760
but there's no mistaking it!

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:08.970
But I didn't see any Sacred
Beasts in our last battle.

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:13.180
Like I said, it's an
invisible Sacred Beast!

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:15.980
That strange wave from his Bey

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:17.390
and the visual noise, too!

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:22.230
It's all the work of a Sacred Beast that's completely invisble to us!

00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:25.400
I imagine that Max and Rei

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:29.820
also lost because they didn't notice their opponents' Sacred Beasts.

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:32.240
Damn! That's low!

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:35.080
W-what are you doing! That's my laptop!

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:37.410
Honestly...

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:38.660
Sorry.

00:06:38.870 --> 00:06:41.460
So, how are you going to fight him?

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:43.710
Isn't it obvious?

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:48.420
Up until now I didn't think he had
the power to call out a Sacred Beast.

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:51.180
But now that I know that he can,

00:06:51.590 --> 00:06:53.720
it means I don't have
to pull any punches!

00:06:58.140 --> 00:06:59.310
Takao...

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:06.190
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:07.610
Are you ready now?

00:07:08.360 --> 00:07:10.570
Ready to get serious?

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:14.280
Yeah, thanks to you.

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:15.950
Let's do it!

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:18.330
A no holds barred showdown!

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:19.500
Come on!

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:22.380
--Go Shoot!

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:31.970
That's it! Keep attacking and don't stop!

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:35.100
I need to record this...!

00:07:39.230 --> 00:07:42.060
Takao's on the attack again.

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:45.610
However, he's oddly defensive...

00:07:45.610 --> 00:07:48.740
What's the matter? Bring it!
Like you did before!

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:52.700
If you won't bring it, I will!

00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:54.660
Dragoon!

00:07:57.790 --> 00:08:01.080
If I remember, this is around the time he began to fight back...

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:09.590
There it is...

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:11.090
There it is!

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:14.430
When the spin speed increases to its maximum,

00:08:14.430 --> 00:08:16.600
it means the invisible
Sacred Beast has taken form!

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:18.680
I need to get a
read on it this time!

00:08:19.100 --> 00:08:20.180
Darn!

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:22.310
Push him back, Dragoon!

00:08:25.350 --> 00:08:28.980
Well? Is that all Dragoon can do?

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:32.240
You can do it!

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:34.740
Don't lose, Takao!

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:40.450
Sorry...

00:08:44.870 --> 00:08:47.250
Hey! Keep the camera steady!

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:50.000
Some kid punched me...

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:51.590
Stay focused.

00:08:51.590 --> 00:08:53.010
You'll corrupt the data.

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:54.510
My bad, bro...

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:58.550
What's your next move, Takao Kinomiya?

00:09:10.860 --> 00:09:11.610
There it is!

00:09:12.690 --> 00:09:16.280
Takao! He summoned his
invisible Sacred Beast!

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:17.240
What?!

00:09:17.740 --> 00:09:18.780
Okay!

00:09:18.780 --> 00:09:20.280
Go, Dragoon!

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:25.120
There's more where
that came from!

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:27.500
Blow him away! This is the end!

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:29.040
Come on out, Seiryu!

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:29.630
Yes!

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:30.590
Move out!

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:38.090
What's the matter, Seiryu?

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:42.140
Takao, hurry!

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:43.520
Seiryu?!

00:09:44.770 --> 00:09:46.190
End him!

00:09:58.280 --> 00:09:59.280
Hiromi!

00:10:00.570 --> 00:10:01.490
What's going on?

00:10:22.890 --> 00:10:24.430
Who won?

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:46.870
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:07.890
Takao...

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:09.730
He lost again...

00:11:09.940 --> 00:11:11.270
Takao...

00:11:11.810 --> 00:11:12.900
We're pulling out.

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:13.860
Yessir.

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:16.440
Why?

00:11:16.730 --> 00:11:17.940
Why?!

00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:30.460
Wait!

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:33.130
Who are you?

00:11:35.210 --> 00:11:36.710
It's just like I said.

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:40.340
If you can't call your Sacred Beast,
then I have nothing to do with you.

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:42.340
Ozma!

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:43.300
Next time...

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:45.720
Next time I see you,
I will defeat you!

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:48.060
Don't think this is over!

00:11:54.770 --> 00:11:55.650
Takao...

00:11:55.980 --> 00:11:58.360
Why didn't you call Seiryu?

00:11:58.610 --> 00:11:59.860
If you did,

00:11:59.860 --> 00:12:02.910
you could have fought
him on even ground...

00:12:03.610 --> 00:12:05.240
It's not that I didn't call him...

00:12:06.370 --> 00:12:07.700
I <b><i>couldn't!</i></b>

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:10.750
Takao...

00:12:15.210 --> 00:12:16.750
Are you okay, Hiromi?

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:19.920
Sorry. I just got a little dizzy.

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:20.920
I'm fine.

00:12:40.860 --> 00:12:42.070
Mr. Kinomiya!

00:12:42.240 --> 00:12:43.110
Takao!

00:12:43.110 --> 00:12:45.450
Late again, Takao?

00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:47.950
Stop right there. Not another word.

00:12:47.950 --> 00:12:49.950
I'm totally safe today.

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:54.500
Because I made it into the classroom before the bell stopped ringing.

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:58.250
Well Hiromi? Got a problem with that?

00:12:58.250 --> 00:12:58.960
Huh?

00:13:01.510 --> 00:13:04.170
It's rare to see Hiromi absent...

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:05.720
I wonder what happened?

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:06.970
Absent?

00:13:07.390 --> 00:13:08.640
Ms. Keiko!

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:12.600
Hiromi got a fever at
the park yesterday!

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:15.940
She might have caught a cold
after getting soaked in the rain!

00:13:17.100 --> 00:13:21.140
Little miss Hiromi with her perfect attendance record...

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:27.950
I bet the virus has bad
taste if it went after Hiromi!

00:13:27.950 --> 00:13:29.620
Hey, Kinomiya!

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:33.250
Who's fault do you think it
is that she caught that cold?

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:35.040
Yeah!

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:40.340
Didn't you ditch your cleaning duty to
battle tops against that boy in the cloak?

00:13:40.540 --> 00:13:42.500
You saying it's my fault?

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:43.550
Um...

00:13:43.550 --> 00:13:46.380
She didn't have to watch my
battle if she didn't want to.

00:13:46.550 --> 00:13:51.760
Takao, you should go to
her house and check on her!

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:52.510
Yup!

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:54.390
You should bring her flowers, too!

00:13:54.890 --> 00:13:56.850
Wait, why should I--

00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:58.350
It's only fair!

00:13:58.350 --> 00:14:00.230
You guys think so too, right?

00:14:00.230 --> 00:14:01.980
--Yeah!

00:14:02.570 --> 00:14:07.990
Um, I think I'd like to start
class now, if that's okay...

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:10.530
Mr. Kinomiya, please take your seat...

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:12.240
Don't you think she...

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:15.450
didn't get a cold? Maybe she's just late!

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:18.210
I bet she's sleeping like a baby in her bed!

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:20.250
Who's late, now?

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:21.840
Hiromi!

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:26.170
I would never oversleep like you.

00:14:26.760 --> 00:14:30.010
I just got some cold
medicine from the nurse's office.

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:32.350
I'm fit as a fiddle!

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:33.470
Sorry to disappoint.

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:36.680
Dude, you don't have to
be so perfect all the time.

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:38.940
I'm not a "dude", I'm a girl!

00:14:41.520 --> 00:14:43.650
No, that's pretty manly...

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:47.490
I want to go to the nurse's office.

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:52.780
As you can see from this image and the data,

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:56.700
There's no evidence that Takao Kinomiya released his Sacred Beast.

00:14:57.250 --> 00:14:59.620
Furthermore, we believe that
the boy he fought against

00:14:59.620 --> 00:15:04.960
was clearly baiting him into
summoning his Sacred Beast.

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:06.840
As I expected.

00:15:07.010 --> 00:15:11.260
What we can say for sure is that he's one hell of a Sacred Beast user.

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:15.220
He's on his toes, to boot--
I tried going after him yesterday,

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:18.060
but he disappeared
in the blink of an eye!

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:22.100
Now that I know that they're
after the Sacred Beasts too,

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:24.860
we don't an advantage anymore.

00:15:27.150 --> 00:15:29.070
Time for us to make our move.

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:31.410
We can't let him stay ahead of us.

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:32.450
--Yes, sir!

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:41.420
So tasty!

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:46.000
Your hunger is terrifying...

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:49.970
Unable to get his revenge, I don't think

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:52.550
Takao is the same as he usually is.

00:15:52.550 --> 00:15:53.970
Well, duh!

00:15:53.970 --> 00:15:56.180
I don't have time to mope around.

00:15:56.180 --> 00:15:58.140
What's important is to try again!

00:15:58.390 --> 00:16:00.480
I'm jealous of your personality.

00:16:00.770 --> 00:16:05.690
Now that all of my data got erased...

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:07.520
Are you gonna finish that?

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:09.280
I'm having seconds!

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:18.990
Why'd it break?

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:23.960
It's because a lot of data beyond my processing power came in.

00:16:33.180 --> 00:16:35.260
Was it the invisible Sacred Beast?

00:16:35.430 --> 00:16:37.140
I don't think it could be anything else.

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:40.470
Whatever it was, its power
levels were incredible.

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:44.600
A level at which we
have never faced before...

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:46.650
But don't you think it's weird?

00:16:46.650 --> 00:16:50.230
We've fought against strong
opponents from all over the world.

00:16:50.230 --> 00:16:53.610
Against guys with incredibly powerful Sacred Beasts.

00:16:53.740 --> 00:16:57.240
Why are they coming to these small towns to battle us?

00:16:57.240 --> 00:16:58.490
That's the point.

00:16:58.950 --> 00:16:59.950
Well?

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:03.250
The people who know of Sacred Beasts here in Japan are...

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:04.750
The two of us,

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:09.500
Kai, and the Chairman
Daitenji from the BBA.

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:12.170
A very small number of people are involved.

00:17:12.840 --> 00:17:18.180
Despite that, the fact that we haven't even heard rumors about Sacred Beast users like him...

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:19.260
It's bizarre!

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:21.470
Right? Don't you agree?

00:17:22.720 --> 00:17:24.600
That was some good food.

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:25.850
Come on, Takao!

00:17:25.850 --> 00:17:27.900
How can you be so calm?

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:29.230
I'm not.

00:17:33.030 --> 00:17:34.320
Takao...

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:35.650
Why...

00:17:35.650 --> 00:17:38.540
couldn't I summon Seiryu?

00:17:38.870 --> 00:17:41.370
There's no way you couldn't.

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:45.500
Until recently you were able to
summon him as usual, right?

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:47.920
Remember carefully.

00:17:48.040 --> 00:17:50.630
No matter the time,
under whatever conditions,

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:53.210
remember how you summoned Seiryu.

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:54.010
Right?

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:01.220
Don't fall asleep, darn it!

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:04.640
What do you think you're doing, Kyoujyu?

00:18:05.680 --> 00:18:08.850
I'm so worried about you, and yet!

00:18:08.850 --> 00:18:10.770
How can you just rub it off?

00:18:12.690 --> 00:18:14.360
Come on, Kyoujyu!

00:18:14.360 --> 00:18:15.940
Kyoujyu, my pal!

00:18:20.200 --> 00:18:22.620
What am I supposed to do?

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:34.670
Darn it...

00:18:37.510 --> 00:18:38.840
Mr. Kinomiya...

00:18:41.050 --> 00:18:47.100
Go Shoot!

00:18:47.230 --> 00:18:48.350
Go...

00:18:57.150 --> 00:18:58.030
Dragoon...

00:18:58.450 --> 00:19:00.700
I forgot how to do it.

00:19:01.570 --> 00:19:04.700
How do I summon you?

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:07.000
You can't just waste
your energy exercising.

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:08.750
Kyoujyu!

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:14.380
To train hard like that,
you need to be organized.

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:18.420
Stick to a calculated
regimen based on data.

00:19:18.420 --> 00:19:21.050
But I can't just keep still!

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:23.760
I'm rushing myself.

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:25.310
I understand.

00:19:25.310 --> 00:19:31.440
Let's think of a special training program so you can remember how to summon your Sacred Beast!

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:33.020
Really, Kyoujyu?

00:19:33.690 --> 00:19:35.270
Just give me a little time!

00:19:35.270 --> 00:19:37.900
I need to repair my computer before that.

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:40.780
You're the best, Kyoujyu!

00:19:40.780 --> 00:19:42.950
You're a genius! A prodigy!

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:45.490
I'm counting on you!

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:49.000
Don't just drop me!

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:01.760
Wait a sec, grandpa!

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:03.300
Your guard is down!

00:20:08.520 --> 00:20:09.520
I did it!

00:20:09.520 --> 00:20:11.690
It's fixed! I fixed it!

00:20:12.020 --> 00:20:13.520
My data is safe and sound.

00:20:13.520 --> 00:20:17.520
Now I just need to make
a training regimen for Takao.

00:20:22.610 --> 00:20:24.410
I bet that's Kyoujyu!

00:20:24.820 --> 00:20:26.530
Sorry, grandpa.

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:30.160
Hello?

00:20:31.160 --> 00:20:32.750
I knew it was you, Kyoujyu!

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:34.000
It's all done!

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:36.750
My training regimen
is all finished, Takao.

00:20:36.750 --> 00:20:37.710
Really?

00:20:37.710 --> 00:20:38.460
Yes!

00:20:38.710 --> 00:20:42.970
Before we begin, I want to take data on your excerising,

00:20:42.970 --> 00:20:45.510
so could you come to the park?

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:47.760
Okay! I'll be right there!

00:20:55.690 --> 00:20:56.770
Kyoujyu!

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:58.110
Hiromi!

00:20:58.360 --> 00:20:59.940
On the way home from cram school?

00:20:59.940 --> 00:21:01.150
Yeah.

00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:07.070
Hey, so, do you know anything about the
boy that Takao fought here the other day?

00:21:07.530 --> 00:21:10.280
We haven't been able to...

00:21:11.750 --> 00:21:12.450
Hiromi!

00:21:12.450 --> 00:21:13.730
Look out!

00:21:14.920 --> 00:21:16.250
What are you doing?

00:21:16.250 --> 00:21:18.170
Who are you people?

00:21:18.880 --> 00:21:20.250
Let me go!

00:21:20.250 --> 00:21:21.090
Move!

00:21:25.510 --> 00:21:26.550
Kyoujyu!

00:21:26.550 --> 00:21:28.390
What kind of training are we gonna do?

00:21:28.390 --> 00:21:29.930
I can't wait to find out!

00:22:56.100 --> 00:22:58.640
The men who kidnapped Hiromi and I

00:22:58.640 --> 00:23:01.100
were after my genius talent!

00:23:01.100 --> 00:23:03.320
If only if it were that simple!

00:23:03.320 --> 00:23:04.690
Huh? That's not it?

00:23:04.690 --> 00:23:06.740
So, what are they really after?

00:23:07.030 --> 00:23:09.280
I can hear the voice of a strange man...

00:23:09.820 --> 00:23:12.070
That Blader is a...

00:23:12.280 --> 00:23:14.740
Takao! Save us quickly!

00:23:14.740 --> 00:23:16.410
This is a life-or-death situation!

00:23:16.410 --> 00:23:19.410
If this keep's up, I'll miss
next week's Beyblade!

00:23:19.410 --> 00:23:23.920
Please watch in my
place, Chairman Daitenji!
